on"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a65eeb21-bcd5-542d-8277-04dab7fa9b53"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-330845"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection/9b5bfcca36ee89a0adaa4c24ab4eddb672a5e261fc7312c6ad730ce800e4c87b" :answer/id #uuid "20c5d8f1-315e-5f98-81d7-cd5dcc8d6a0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection/042730e0bcbcd4c502ca1b2ff33df62a0e87f9868c7635260e11c5b4bb25402c" :answer/id #uuid "3499ec3c-af21-540f-82dd-3b29b6b87b24" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection/5937a6d3f08652492e59e8b1afceee375ba8651aa49150d70f5ec421f9037d40" :answer/id #uuid "dba0d752-e2ae-5815-815a-ddea162f3cd1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(t))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection/a1f7ca82862d16afe40fe5a1d59811c3a8d93f288d2f34bb2876907c01acb4bd" :answer/id #uuid "140946c5-a2e6-561e-8a5a-cea3612338e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection/e0592f9a7b035514a54a32dd13f66dbf04bb27f166ccae0d6519d5fa87184baa" :answer/id #uuid "d0a7af40-380e-5325-b128-5f2b3a787bdf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "76a7ef8a-6e41-5ecb-8e1c-900979b600fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-330838/selection/a1f7ca82862d16afe40fe5a1d59811c3a8d93f288d2f34bb2876907c01acb4bd" :answer-field/choices ["q-330838/selection/9b5bfcca36ee89a0adaa4c24ab4eddb672a5e261fc7312c6ad730ce800e4c87b" "q-330838/selection/042730e0bcbcd4c502ca1b2ff33df62a0e87f9868c7635260e11c5b4bb25402c" "q-330838/selection/5937a6d3f08652492e59e8b1afceee375ba8651aa49150d70f5ec421f9037d40" "q-330838/selection/a1f7ca82862d16afe40fe5a1d59811c3a8d93f288d2f34bb2876907c01acb4bd" "q-330838/selection/e0592f9a7b035514a54a32dd13f66dbf04bb27f166ccae0d6519d5fa87184baa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330838" :question/id #uuid "60e4c590-2cee-5f38-a80e-2339267d9a2b" :question/math-academy-id "q-330838" :question/problem "For the function\n\n$$\nG(s)=\\frac{1}{s({s}^{2}+4)},\\,s>0\n$$\n\nfind the inverse Laplace transform of $G(s),$ given that\n$L{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\omega t)}=\\frac{\\omega }{{s}^{2}+{\\omega }^{2}}.$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that we can write $G(s)$ as \n\n$$\nG(s)=\\frac{1}{s({s}^{2}+4)}=\\frac{F(s)}{s},\n$$\n\nwhere $F(s)=\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}+4}.$\nAlso, we know that\n\n$$\nL{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\omega t)}=\\frac{\\omega }{{s}^{2}+{\\omega }^{2}}.\n$$\n\nThus, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}{F(s)} & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}+4}} \\\\  & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{{s}^{2}+4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{L}^{-1}{\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}+{2}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we know that if $L{f(t)}=F(s)$, then\n\n$$\nL{{\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,\\text{d}τ}=\\frac{F(s)}{s}.\n$$\n\nUsing the property above in reverse, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}{G(s)} & ={L}^{-1}{\\frac{F(s)}{s}} \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,\\text{d}τ \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2τ)\\,\\text{d}τ \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2τ)\\,{|}_{0}^{t} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-330838/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a65eeb21-bcd5-542d-8277-04dab7fa9b53"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-330838"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-330849/selection/455a84a1bb702b240da5c542c